  "description": "[Original Web Novel](https://series.naver.com/novel/detail.series?productNo=4732363)\n\n**Original Webtoon:**  \n[Naver Webtoon](https://comic.naver.com/webtoon/list?titleId=797943), [Naver Series](https://series.naver.com/comic/detail.series?productNo=8650771)\n\n**Official Translations:**  \n[Japanese](https://manga.line.me/product/periodic?id=Z0002724)                                                                  \n\n\n\n\n My sister was abandoned by her fiancé and tragically died. If only I could turn back time... I would never let her be with a man like that! Hae-min is determined to become her sister's manager and fight for her happiness. But what am I supposed to do when that despicable man, the one who caused all this, tries to seduce me?",
